      "writtenOn": "2024-05-17T15:51:28Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "My gut reaction is that this structure is better (one copy of the flow control, with N copies of the simple uniform math, vs. 3 copies of the flow control), but I know better than to trust my intuition about GPU performance.\n\nI\u0027m also not confident that any of our benchmarking is good enough to detect a change, so :shrug:.",
